  "details": "Issue in: Build 1048\nWhen in worlds with both PC and Quest users, synced pickups are different between Quest and PC. It isnt per user, as the pickups seem to be consistently mismatched based on platform. It also doesnt seem to be an issue with every pickup, but is extremely common. My guess is that the network ids arent reliably consistent between the 2 platforms, and are being assigned wrong.\nReproduce: Have a world with multiple unique synced pickups, and have both Quest and PC users compare which pickups are where. In most cases, they will be different per platform.",
